WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:09.000
A masked teacher stands beside masked students at desks. Stylized virus particles float above them, and an air-handling unit stands near the board. This is an animated classroom, not a monitored or measured school.

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:20.000
A fan inside a school-building outline represents ventilation. Four labeled illustrations show exhaled air, student attendance, climate and utility costs. Labels, people, a thermometer and a meter distinguish the factors independently of color.
